# <%= current_page.data.title %>

### Overview

As part of the migrations handover process, the team is conducting weekly knowledge transfer sessions on various key elements of DSO / Probations migration efforts. These sessions are recorded and can be found on the [Platform Operations Sharepoint Site here](https://justiceuk.sharepoint.com/sites/PlatformOperations/Shared%20Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?id=%2Fsites%2FPlatformOperations%2FShared%20Documents%2FKnowledge%20Transfer%20Sessions&viewid=cb60ad7d%2D75cf%2D45be%2D8818%2D41d661babd79).

The focus of each session varies depending on the environment in question, but included here are some great introductory / onboarding resources covering items such as:

- Modernisation Platform overview / repository structure, and our common development workflows here.
- Azure tenant and App Insights user management
- Monitoring and Alerting setup and management
- Common DSO and Probations support duties

